[ virtual_sites3 ]
; The position of the virtual site is computed as follows:
;
; The distance from OW to L is 0.041 nm, the geometry is tetrahedral
; (109.47 deg)
; Therefore, a = b = - 0.041 * cos (109.47/2) / | xOH1 + xOH2 |
;            c = 0.041 * sin (109.47/2) / | xOH1 X xOH2 |
;
; Using | xOH1 X xOH2 | = | xOH1 | | xOH2 | sin (H1-O-H2)
;       | xOH1 + xOH2 | = 2 | xOH1 | cos (H1-O-H2/2)
; Vsite pos x4 = x1 + a*x21 + b*x31 + c*(x21 X x31)

; Vsite from                    funct   a          b           c
